title: Remove pallet::getter usage from pallet-node-authorization
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Replaces the `#[pallet::getter]` attributes of `pallet-node-authorization` with explicit public
    functions on `Pallet<T>`. `well_known_nodes()`, `owners()` and `additional_connection()` keep
    their signatures, so no changes are needed downstream.
crates:
- name: pallet-node-authorization
  bump: minor
